# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Roua Trading (رؤى) — .gitignore
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── Dependencies ──
node_modules/
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions
bun.lock

# ── Testing ──
/coverage

# ── Next.js ──
.next/
/out/
apps/web/.next/

# ── NestJS Build ──
dist/
apps/api/dist/

# ── Production ──
/build

# ── Environment Files (NEVER commit secrets!) ──
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.production
.env.production.local
apps/web/.env
apps/api/.env
# Keep .env.example for documentation
!.env.example

# ── Database ──
db/
*.db
*.db-journal

# ── Misc ──
.DS_Store
*.pem
Thumbs.db

# ── Debug Logs ──
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
bun-debug.log*
*.log
dev.log
server.log

# ── TypeScript ──
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# ── Vercel ──
.vercel

# ── IDE ──
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# ── Claude / AI ──
.claude
.z-ai-config
local-*
prompt
test

# ── Skills Directory ──
/skills/

# ── Prisma ──
apps/web/prisma/migrations/

# ── Upload / Download ──
upload/
download/
.turbo/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
